<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  v0.21.0 (audit D-F3) — dedicated STATUS-BAR notification icon.
  The old small icon was the full-colour adaptive launcher (white heart on a
  green plate): status-bar icons are alpha-tinted, so it rendered as a filled
  blob on stock Android and was near-invisible on several OEM skins (MIUI /
  One UI). A monochrome phone glyph reads correctly in every tint.
-->
